  "notes": [
   "The section is shared: 'Public Policy, Associate Degree or Certificate of Achievement' prints one requirement list and one Program Learning Outcomes paragraph for both awards; recorded for the A.A. degree.",
   "The outcomes are printed as one paragraph. The first outcome begins inside the lead-in sentence ('Upon completion of the program, students will demonstrate ...'). It is recorded from 'demonstrate' onward.",
   "No total for the whole degree is printed for this award. The 60-unit sentence is the generic associate degree requirement. GE options are 'SMC GE or Cal-GETC'.",
   "The 'or' between POLS C1000 and POL SC 3 in the Required Core Course spans a page break.",
   "AREA A and AREA B fall under the heading 'Critical Thinking and Communication:'. Each is read as choosing 3 units (one course).",
   "Specialization Areas: students take 2 courses within one of five tracks (6 units). The 6-unit total is printed once for the specialization area and is applied to each track block.",
   "Cross-listed courses (ENVRN 20/PHILOS 20, ENVRN 22/POL SC 22, ENVRN 40/PSYCH 40, ENVRN 7/GEOG 7, HEALTH 60/NURSNG 60, GEOG 8/URBAN 8) are printed as separate rows and recorded separately.",
   "Catalog typos: ENVRN 7 says 'same as ENVRN 7' and GEOG 8 says 'same as GEOG 8'.",
   "Closed-list code 'NUTR7' is matched to the catalog's NUTR 7, and 'SOCIOL 2S' to the catalog's SOCIOL 2s.",
   "Lists A-C at the top of page 188 belong to the preceding program and were not recorded.",
   "The Career Opportunities bullet appears under Programs Offered, but no careers are named."
